IMPORTANT DESIGN REFERENCE

Build the website with a design style very similar to AVI Clinic.

Reference Website:
https://www.avi.clinic/

The final website should have:

* Clean premium healthcare branding
* Minimalist modern UI
* White background with medical blue accents
* Large hero section with image and CTA buttons
* Rounded cards and sections
* Spacious layouts with lots of white space
* Professional typography
* Smooth scrolling animations
* Premium doctor profile cards
* Modern appointment booking section
* Hospital statistics counters
* Testimonials carousel
* Responsive mobile-first design
* Sticky navigation bar
* Elegant hover effects
* Professional medical imagery

PAGE STRUCTURE

1. Sticky Header

   * Hospital Logo
   * Home
   * About
   * Doctors
   * Departments
   * Services
   * Contact
   * Book Appointment button

2. Hero Section

   * Modern split-screen layout
   * Left side:

     * Main heading
     * Description
     * Book Appointment button
     * Call Now button
   * Right side:

     * Professional healthcare image

3. Statistics Section

   * 20 Beds
   * Expert Doctors
   * Emergency Care
   * Affordable Treatment

4. About Hospital Section

   * Modern image + text layout

5. Specialities Section

   * Orthopaedics
   * General Medicine
   * Critical Care
   * Gynecology
   * Pediatrics
   * Urology

6. Meet Our Doctors

   * Large doctor cards
   * Doctor image
   * Qualification
   * Specialty
   * Appointment button

7. Services Grid

   * 15 hospital services
   * Modern icon cards

8. Emergency Banner

   * Red emergency section
   * Call +91 9966990001

9. Testimonials Section

10. Appointment Booking Section

11. Gallery Section

12. Contact + Google Map

13. Premium Footer

DESIGN QUALITY

The website should feel like a ₹10 lakh professionally designed hospital website and should not look like a template.

Use:

* Framer Motion animations
* Glassmorphism effects where appropriate
* Modern gradients
* Soft shadows
* Smooth transitions
* Premium UI components
* High-quality placeholder medical images

The final result should be visually comparable to top private hospitals and very close in quality and layout style to AVI Clinic.
